      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792094036598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. extract skills from trace\n    - same skill_name \n        - update version\n    - active based on eval score\n        - human in the loop?\n    - insert experiment\n2. rule / hook\n    - from reflect \n        - suggestions\n        - register to rule/hook_engine\n            - auto generated = True\n3. Maintain Lifecycle\n    - by looking at trigger count \n    - by looking at success rate\n\n        \n    \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 468,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. extract skills from trace\n    - same skill_name \n        - update version\n    - active based on eval score\n        - human in the loop?\n    - insert experiment\n2. rule / hook\n    - from reflect \n        - suggestions\n        - register to rule/hook_engine\n            - auto generated = True\n3. Maintain Lifecycle\n    - by looking at trigger count \n    - by looking at success rate\n\n        \n    \n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
